          },
          "code": "EMAIL_PURPOSE",
          "id": "1769394353793",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769394353794_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "let emailJsonVar= {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.emailJson}}\n\n{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTAGENTEMAILPROMPT.$output.result.mainPrompt}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"IsInvalidFlow\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"isExpenseReportFlow\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"classification\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"INVALID\",\n        \"REPORT\",\n        \"NEITHER\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"expenseReportNumber\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"Reasoning\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"IsInvalidFlow\",\n    \"isExpenseReportFlow\",\n    \"classification\",\n    \"expenseReportNumber\",\n    \"Reasoning\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "ExtractAgentEmailPrompt",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const defaultMainPrompt = `-- TASK @ DEFAULT VERSION --\n\nInput:\nUse emailJsonVar input with the following fields:\n\n- subject\n- bodyPlain\n- bodyHtml\n- hasAttachments\n\nTask:\nClassify the email as one of the following:\n1. Invalid Flow\n2. Expense Report Flow\n3. Neither\n\n==================================================\n1. Invalid Flow\n==================================================\n\nSet IsInvalidFlow = true only if the email is:\n\n- an Out of Office or Automatic Reply, or\n- an email generated solely because someone reacted to an email with an emoji or message reaction (like, thumbs up, heart, smile, etc.), with no expense-related user request.\n\nOtherwise set IsInvalidFlow = false.\n\n==================================================\n2. Expense Report Flow\n==================================================\n\nEvaluate only if IsInvalidFlow = false.\n\nSet isExpenseReportFlow = true if the subject or body mentions any of the following:\n\n- Expense Report\n- Expense Approval\n- Expense Report Approval\n- Expense Report Number\n- Expense Report ID\n- Applied to Expense Report\n- Approved Expense Report\n- Rejected Expense Report\n- Returned Expense Report\n- Cash Advance\n- Expense Bundle\n- Bundle Submission\n- Group Submission\n\nOtherwise set isExpenseReportFlow = false.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nExpense Report Number Extraction\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nIf isExpenseReportFlow = true, extract expenseReportNumber.\n\nRules:\n- Look for text such as:\n  - Expense Report <value>\n  - Expense Report Number: <value>\n  - Expense Report ID: <value>\n  - Applied to Expense Report <value>\n- Capture the dynamic report identifier immediately following the phrase.\n- Preserve the extracted value exactly as written.\n- Do not modify or normalize the value.\n- If no report number is found, return an empty string.\n\nExamples:\n- \"Applied to Expense Report EXM12688\"\n  -> expenseReportNumber = \"EXM12688\"\n\n- \"Expense Report Number: ABC12345\"\n  -> expenseReportNumber = \"ABC12345\"\n\nIf isExpenseReportFlow = false:\n- expenseReportNumber = \"\"\n\n==================================================\n3. Classification\n==================================================\n\nReturn exactly one classification using the following priority:\n\n- If IsInvalidFlow = true\n  classification = \"INVALID\"\n\n- Else if isExpenseReportFlow = true\n  classification = \"REPORT\"\n\n- Else\n  classification = \"NEITHER\"\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT\n==================================================\n\nReturn valid JSON only:\n\n{\n  \"IsInvalidFlow\": true|false,\n  \"isExpenseReportFlow\": true|false,\n  \"classification\": \"INVALID\" | \"REPORT\" | \"NEITHER\",\n  \"expenseReportNumber\": \"<extracted expense report number or empty string>\",\n  \"Reasoning\": \"State which rule matched, the evidence from the subject/body, and if applicable how the expense report number was extracted.\"\n}\n`;\n\nconst out = $context.$nodes.GETAGENTEMAILPROMPT.$output;\nconst prompts = Array.isArray(out?.prompts) ? out.prompts : [];\nlet mainPrompt = prompts?.find(p => p.promptType === \"MAIN\")?.prompt || defaultMainPrompt;\n\nlet prompt = {\n  mainPrompt: mainPrompt\n};\n\nreturn prompt;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769394353793"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACTAGENTEMAILPROMPT",
          "id": "1773042461086",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
