        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "ExtractDelegateIdentifierPrompt",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const defaultMainPrompt = `-- TASK @ DEFAULT VERSION --\n\nROLE:\nExpense Delegate Flow Identifier.\n\nINPUT: email\nUser email containing the following \n- subject - \n- bodyPlain\n-bodyHtml\n\nTASK:\nDetermine whether the email  indicates that the expense is being submitted or acted on for another person.\n\nDelegate Flow:\n\nSet isDelegateFlow = true only if the userMessage clearly indicates the expense is being submitted, created, updated, approved, or acted on for another person.\n\nExamples of delegation:\n- on behalf of ...\n- representing ...\n- at the request of ...\n- with authority from ...\n- in place of ...\n- for my manager ...\n- for my executive ...\n\nExtract delegatorIdentifier:\n\n- Return only the delegated person's name or email.\n- If both a role and a person's name/email are present, return only the person's name/email.\n- If delegation is clear but no name/email is present, return null.\n\nDo NOT classify as Delegate Flow for:\n- for me\n- my own expense\n- expense id/reference numbers\n- mentioning another person's name without indicating you are acting for them\n- role names without a clear delegation statement\n\nIf the message does not clearly indicate delegation:\n- isDelegateFlow = false\n- delegatorIdentifier = null\n\nReturn valid JSON only:\n\n{\n  \"isDelegateFlow\": true|false,\n  \"delegatorIdentifier\": \"<name|email|null>\",\n  \"Reasoning\": \"Explain exactly which part of the userMessage determined the result in detail\"\n}\n`;\n\nconst out = $context.$nodes.GETDELGATEIDENTIFYPROMPT.$output;\nconst prompts = Array.isArray(out?.prompts) ? out.prompts : [];\nlet mainPrompt = prompts?.find(p => p.promptType === \"MAIN\")?.prompt || defaultMainPrompt;\n\nlet prompt = {\n  mainPrompt: mainPrompt\n};\n\nreturn prompt;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1784473442392"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACTDELEGATEIDENTIFIERPROMPT",
          "id": "1784473316746",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
